HOUSE BILL NO. HB0248
School foundation program interim budget authority.
Sponsored by: Representative(s) Bear and Senator(s) Salazar
A BILL
for
1 AN ACT relating to administration of the government;
2 prohibiting the governor from authorizing increases to
3 legislative appropriation acts from the public school
4 foundation program account; providing an exception; and
5 providing for an effective date.
6
7 Be It Enacted by the Legislature of the State of Wyoming:
8
9 Section 1. W.S. 9-2-1005(c) by creating a new
10 paragraph (iii) is amended to read:
11
12 9-2-1005. Payment of warrants; budget powers of
13 governor; agency budgets; federal funds; new employees.
14
15 (c) The governor shall not:
